				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>No Well because of the subject I mean I moved so quickly into logic and you were so sure that that's what you wanted to do It kind of engulfed you after a year Now I don't remember when I started going to the seminar but again the experience there was he wanted people to present things in the seminar so I immediately volunteered to do some stuff which required me to work things out for myself in a certain initial part of the subject.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
