		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a131" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts260" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts261">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>He asked people who wanted to do one and you volunteered?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a132" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts262" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts263">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah right early on right early on or maybe he asked if I would do it and he said I would try so it was a subject I didn't know anything about specificly and I did a real good job and so that was in retrospect that was what I had to do the job on was really pretty trivial stuff but at the time it seemed like a big deal to me and he was very complimentary and very encouraging so that was a good start That was his style in fact I think to encourage people and to compliment people early on Early stages to suck them in Yeah But I mean he always was very encouraging for people to come then if they didn't do it then that was trouble but initially he was never discouraging I think he always encouraged people Well there were these two parts to my studying with him one is how great I thought he was and the subject The second was that I saw I could do things the way he liked to see them done and then I had no problem in other words if other people did things in seminar that upset him I understood what it was.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a133" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts264" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts265">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know I had that same sensibility about what the problems were, about the way they were doing things and if I had a presentation to make, I knew what would be required You knew what would satisfy him I knew what would satisfy him and that also satisfied you satisfied me yeah and that wasn't I think sort of the way Bob was talking about it was if by being by his coming down hard on people that that was the way they learned to do things the right way and that you had to in order to get people the right way in a way that wasn't my experience.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a134" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts266" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts267">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>He didn't have to come down hard on me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
