				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Some people seemed to get it and the people who didn't get it maybe never got it or got it with a Did you ever see if you look back Were there people who turned he may say that there were people who really had trouble at first but were able to put themselves were able to put themselves together to do things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
