				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>That Bob said that maybe about he himself or about somebody else I don't remember his view was that that was necessary In my case I just swung with him so that was and I can't explain why how it is that one person can do that and another can't.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
