				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's not a matter of intelligence style sensitivity to certain things It's just like in a way almost like spelling or pronunciation that some people can get aren't sensitive to those things and yet that doesn't mean like Jerry's insane to pronunciation I think he's not aware of when he talks to people how his way of talking may not be the best way to communicate.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
