				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well that's not pronunciation I think it's partly pronunciation he swallows There's a certain garbled as a taught So Richard wants to take a Becktail course to improve in English to improve his pronunciation Oh yeah Is he gonna do it?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
