			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a142" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts282" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts283">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Say he's going to It's a little analogous Yeah maybe not a good analogy No I don't think it's so obviously different people are sensitive to different things but those things were important to Tarski and Formulation Formulation Careful Formulation Precision Choice of symbols, choice of terminology development systematic development so if something is supposed to come before something else you make sure that it comes before you don't do it as an afterthought Soder order So there's a whole bundle of things there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
