			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a167" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts332" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts333">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>You wouldn't have had to have a vat covering every seam of wood coming together in the house, but that detail is something that contributes to the final beauty and design of the house so that every small detail in a sense adds up to the integrity of the house.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
