				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sure, there's so selection of I mean when you say does it all have to be there, maybe some other person could succeed in proving the same result by a different avenue which didn't make use of those same details So you can't say aesthetic in a way partly aesthetic right partly a matter of taste that which way you like to do things But once he had a particular plan then all the details are there too that need to be there And you felt never more than there weren't extraneous details that didn't need to be there Well in the end I did.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
